{This shows that $e_{k+1}(\theta)$ is {weakly} decreasing in $\ell_k$.} 
By the inductive definitions, the efforts $e_{k+2},\dots e_{j-1}$
are non-increasing, while {$\tilde e_{j-1}$ is strictly decreasing, due to the change of $\ell_j$.  This in turn implies that $e_j$
is weakly decreasing in $\psi_j$.}
}
\end{proof}

